msgstr "It normally decides from the frame whether it needs to act."

msgid "自身攻击卡牌伤害总量提升30%"
msgstr "Increases this unit's total attack card damage by 30%."

msgid "默认刷闪光优先级第一张，可刷神闪，第一层没刷出自动逃脱"
msgstr ""
"Farms the first entry in Epiphany Priority, so it can chase a Divine Epiphany. "
"Retreats automatically if floor 1 does not produce one."

msgid "填写目标卡牌名称后反复刷新初始卡牌；不能与“刷空档”同时使用。"
msgstr ""
"Enter a card name to reroll the starting card until it appears. Cannot be "
"used together with Farm Gaps."

msgid "卡牌名称和描述无需完整填写，输入几个关键字即可，但顺序须与游戏原文一致。"
msgstr ""
"Card names and descriptions do not need to be complete. A few keywords are "
"enough, but they must appear in the same order as in the game."

msgid "初始任务必须包含“移除2张”，否则重新开始；不能与“刷初始卡牌”同时使用。"
msgstr ""
"The starting task must include Remove 2 Cards, otherwise the run restarts. "
"Cannot be used together with Farm Starting Card."

msgid "自动模式仅在内存不少于12GB的Intel设备上使用OpenVINO，其他设备使用ONNX Runtime。修改后重启程序生效。"
msgstr ""
"Auto only uses OpenVINO on Intel machines with at least 12 GB of RAM, and "
"ONNX Runtime everywhere else. Restart the app after changing this."

msgid ""
"开启后每5分钟自动上传匿名的配置信息和胜率，帮助统计热门配置。\n"
"不上传任何个人信息、游戏账号、截图、IP地址等隐私数据。\n"
"仅上传配置内容和胜率统计数据。"
msgstr ""
"Uploads your anonymous config and win rate every 5 minutes to help compile popular configs.\n"
"It never uploads personal information, game accounts, screenshots or IP addresses.\n"
"This fork defaults it off, because the pool is the upstream CN community's and Global card names do not match it."

msgid ""
"1.剧情内战斗关卡可手动开启出击模式调用自动战斗功能。\n"
"2. 遇到卡厄思关卡请手动打开卡厄思模式。\n"
"3. 剧情战斗关卡队伍需手动配置"
msgstr ""
"Skips dialogue only. Switch to Sortie or Chaos Manifestation by hand when a "
"battle starts."

